<page type="text" lines="ocr">
  <layout>One page of text, running head at top; title block and verse epitaph in the centre; no margin notes; page number at foot right.</layout>
  <page_number>14</page_number>
  <running_head>EPITAPHIA.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">CL. V. FRANCISCI</l>
    <l n="2">HOTO-mani, Parisiis ex Senatoria</l>
    <l n="3">Hotomanorum familia nati, magni</l>
    <l n="4">verae Iurisprudentiae noftro feculo ornamenti,</l>
    <l n="5">bonarum artium cognitione</l>
    <l n="6">politiffimi, amici, &amp; in eodem religionis</l>
    <l n="7">ergo exilio socij perpetui, Memoriae.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">
      <i>EX hoc, Viator, paucula</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>Dignare saxo discere.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>Quem diuiti Lutetia,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>Quem ditibus parentibus,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>Honoribus quem maximis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>Christi crucis ludibria,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Et quidquid immanis iubet</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Vis impiorum perpeti,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Decies quaternos quatuor</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>Fortem per annos vidimus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>Perferre tempestatibus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>Nullisque territum malis:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Quo sensa iuris intima,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>Legumque nodos omnium,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>Mirabili facundia</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>Soluente, tota Gallica,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Et totius Germanica</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>Plausere pubis pulpita.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26" para="true">
      <i>HOTOMANVS HIC MAGNVS IACET.</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Printed page number "14" read from the foot right "I 4"; the verse is set in italic. Some letters in the top rule and small marks at the right margin are not text. Possible misreads: "Quo sensa" and "Vis impiorum" in the verse, and the page number, which is uncertain.</notes>
</page>
